      "heading": null,
      "heading_hint": null,
      "is_heading": false,
      "text": "1.1 This Renewal Agreement (\u201cRenewal\u201d) extends and renews the Multi-Year Supply Framework Agreement (\u201cOriginal Agreement\u201d) executed on 1 July 2021 and last renewed on 1 July 2023, between PrimeVolta Hardware Solutions, incorporated under the Companies Act, 2013 (\u201cVendor\u201d), and FinSecure Services, a BFSI services provider (\u201cClient\u201d).",
      "source_location": {
        "doc_id": "TXN-002",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "locator": "paragraph:5",
        "excerpt": "1.1 This Renewal Agreement (\u201cRenewal\u201d) extends and renews the Multi-Year Supply Framework Agreement (\u201cOriginal Agreement\u201d) executed on 1 July 2021 and last renewed on 1 July 2023, between PrimeVolta Hardware Solutions, incorporated under the Companies Act, 2013 (\u201cVendor\u201d), and FinSecure Services, a BFSI services provider (\u201cClient\u201d)."
      }
    },
    {
